Context Mode: when a store is attached, exec/read_file store
their raw output on disk and return a capped summary + handle;
ctx_read puts the raw output back into the context on demand.

Bare filename: the citation claims the file exists in the
repo (commonly in a conventional home like tests/);
one or more matches make it live.

METRICS.md section 6: the verdict vocabulary.  "in-progress" is the
explicit state of an experiment whose window has not closed yet;
"pending" is accepted as a synonym and normalized to it on write.
